(7258491, 1129026, 98339, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this much higher if you had isolated your "Z" area.  To me the FG and the BG (white area) are very distracting but if you had straightened the lovely curve on the right side leading the eye to your "Z".  I would have scored it much higher.  Good colors</td>', 'I would have scored this much higher if you had isolated your "Z" area.  To me the FG and the BG (white area) are very distracting but if you had straightened the lovely curve on the right side leading the eye to your "Z".  I would have scored it much higher.  Good colors', '2014-09-03 20:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
