(7258536, 1128999, 13077, '<td valign="top">Some kind of sea creature I''m guessing, from the name? I like how it''s upside down, kind of throws you off at first.</td>', 'Some kind of sea creature I''m guessing, from the name? I like how it''s upside down, kind of throws you off at first.', '2014-09-03 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258537, 1128607, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I like the way the focus falls off going down the wheel, and the tones look good.</td>', 'Very cool. I like the way the focus falls off going down the wheel, and the tones look good.', '2014-09-03 21:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258538, 1129045, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good macro; I''m not seeing the abstract part, but I like the angle you shot it at and it''s composed well.</td>', 'Good macro; I''m not seeing the abstract part, but I like the angle you shot it at and it''s composed well.', '2014-09-03 21:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258539, 1128969, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting and the lines and patterns really draw you in. Can''t figure out what it is, so it meets the challenge well.</td>', 'It''s interesting and the lines and patterns really draw you in. Can''t figure out what it is, so it meets the challenge well.', '2014-09-03 21:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258540, 1128930, 13077, '<td valign="top">Is it a slinky? My first thought was a dryer duct, but now I''m not so sure. I think it could have benefited from better lighting, and the brightest point of the image could have been on the subject rather than the surface to the bottom left.</td>', 'Is it a slinky? My first thought was a dryer duct, but now I''m not so sure. I think it could have benefited from better lighting, and the brightest point of the image could have been on the subject rather than the surface to the bottom left.', '2014-09-03 21:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258541, 1128706, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo, good focus and good tones. The background is pleasing to look at and the subject (part of a flower or some kind of plant is my guess?) stands out well.</td>', 'Very interesting photo, good focus and good tones. The background is pleasing to look at and the subject (part of a flower or some kind of plant is my guess?) stands out well.', '2014-09-03 21:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258542, 1128503, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s a good abstract, can''t guess what it is, but it could have benefited from more controlled lighting or at least avoiding the bright highlights in the foreground and the flare from the highlight on top. Something about the background looks a bit unpleasant too.</td>', 'It''s a good abstract, can''t guess what it is, but it could have benefited from more controlled lighting or at least avoiding the bright highlights in the foreground and the flare from the highlight on top. Something about the background looks a bit unpleasant too.', '2014-09-03 21:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258543, 1129001, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a lot to look at. Interesting patterns but I think either more depth of field to include the strands at the top right and the left, or a shallower depth of field, would have helped it.</td>', 'Wow, that''s a lot to look at. Interesting patterns but I think either more depth of field to include the strands at the top right and the left, or a shallower depth of field, would have helped it.', '2014-09-03 21:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258544, 1128480, 13077, '<td valign="top">My first thought was used vacuum filter. Nice unusual view of a mushroom though,  Nice colors and lighting.</td>', 'My first thought was used vacuum filter. Nice unusual view of a mushroom though,  Nice colors and lighting.', '2014-09-03 21:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258545, 1128574, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I can''t tell if it was a reflection, or shot through a thin sheet of water, or something else. Pleasing to look at though, would look good as a print.</td>', 'Very interesting. I can''t tell if it was a reflection, or shot through a thin sheet of water, or something else. Pleasing to look at though, would look good as a print.', '2014-09-03 21:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258546, 1129026, 13077, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what it is, so that part meets the challenge. The depth of field is good, but I would say it could have been helped by composing to avoid the bright highlights in the background.</td>', 'Can''t tell what it is, so that part meets the challenge. The depth of field is good, but I would say it could have been helped by composing to avoid the bright highlights in the background.', '2014-09-03 21:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258547, 1129036, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow - very interesting photo. I''m guessing they are water droplets but I can''t figure out the curve shapes.</td>', 'Wow - very interesting photo. I''m guessing they are water droplets but I can''t figure out the curve shapes.', '2014-09-03 21:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258548, 1128964, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Seems like some motion blur though or maybe out of focus, nothing looks sharp.</td>', 'Interesting. Seems like some motion blur though or maybe out of focus, nothing looks sharp.', '2014-09-03 21:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7258601, 1129026, 30861, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. I think it''s killer. Macro-as-landscape is one of my favorite things, and this canyon running to an infinite sky is my idea of an eerie, alien landscape.</td>', 'I gave this a 9. I think it''s killer. Macro-as-landscape is one of my favorite things, and this canyon running to an infinite sky is my idea of an eerie, alien landscape.', '2014-09-03 22:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
