(7259487, 1129036, 174999, '<td valign="top">There must have been some telepathy going on because having two of these "almost" alike has shown different hues and composition..  I do like these bubble abstracts better, makes it look like its just floating in the air.. the color tones are fun and make it look like planets.<br/>I bumped up the vote as well</td>', 'There must have been some telepathy going on because having two of these "almost" alike has shown different hues and composition..  I do like these bubble abstracts better, makes it look like its just floating in the air.. the color tones are fun and make it look like planets.I bumped up the vote as well', '2014-09-05 14:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
