(7259642, 1128988, 13077, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what it is exactly, but personally I''m not a fan of the water specks. The blue swirl inside the thing in the center (a funnel or a drain of some kind maybe) is intriguing, but something about the surface it''s attached to looks kind of odd. I think not having the water specks might help with that.</td>', 'I can''t tell what it is exactly, but personally I''m not a fan of the water specks. The blue swirl inside the thing in the center (a funnel or a drain of some kind maybe) is intriguing, but something about the surface it''s attached to looks kind of odd. I think not having the water specks might help with that.', '2014-09-05 19:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259644, 1128504, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and it definitely seems abstract. I would have prefered to see something sharp in the photo, though.</td>', 'Interesting composition and it definitely seems abstract. I would have prefered to see something sharp in the photo, though.', '2014-09-05 19:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259646, 1128787, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is interesting with the colors and shapes, but there may have been a more attractive way to compose this. It also looks like there''s too much noise reduction that has been applied, for abstract I might have actually added grain in processing and kept some sharpness on parts of the photo.</td>', 'This is interesting with the colors and shapes, but there may have been a more attractive way to compose this. It also looks like there''s too much noise reduction that has been applied, for abstract I might have actually added grain in processing and kept some sharpness on parts of the photo.', '2014-09-05 19:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259647, 1128502, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and contrast, but the blown out highlights and lack of anything really sharp could be improved on.</td>', 'I like the colors and contrast, but the blown out highlights and lack of anything really sharp could be improved on.', '2014-09-05 19:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259648, 1129003, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is interesting to look at. I don''t know if the haze was added in post or just due to the conditions but I like the fact that the tips of the plant are pretty sharp. I might recommend more of an S-curve or just added contrast and maybe some more red added in for the shadows and midtones. I feel like the reflections on the plant that is in focus could have been eliminated for a simpler photo overall and it would look nicer.</td>', 'This is interesting to look at. I don''t know if the haze was added in post or just due to the conditions but I like the fact that the tips of the plant are pretty sharp. I might recommend more of an S-curve or just added contrast and maybe some more red added in for the shadows and midtones. I feel like the reflections on the plant that is in focus could have been eliminated for a simpler photo overall and it would look nicer.', '2014-09-05 19:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259650, 1128524, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes in this one and the grain. If you added it in post, well done, and if not, good call to skip the noise reduction. This could make a good framed print with a simple mat and frame. I would recommend cloning out the smudges near the top center and above the bottom swirl.</td>', 'I like the shapes in this one and the grain. If you added it in post, well done, and if not, good call to skip the noise reduction. This could make a good framed print with a simple mat and frame. I would recommend cloning out the smudges near the top center and above the bottom swirl.', '2014-09-05 19:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259651, 1128601, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t think having 99% of the image out of focus and colored in dull tones is doing this photo any favors. Some more sharpness on the in-focus subject at the bottom would also help. If you would have angled the camera parallel to the leg (if that''s what you call it), the whole thing would have been in focus and you could have kept the bokeh in the background and made it look like less of an accident for lack of a better word.</td>', 'I don''t think having 99% of the image out of focus and colored in dull tones is doing this photo any favors. Some more sharpness on the in-focus subject at the bottom would also help. If you would have angled the camera parallel to the leg (if that''s what you call it), the whole thing would have been in focus and you could have kept the bokeh in the background and made it look like less of an accident for lack of a better word.', '2014-09-05 19:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259653, 1128615, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been improved with a cleaner surface to set the rubber bands on. I would also have used a smaller aperture for a bit more depth of field, to include the closest part of the first bundle. This looks like a controlled environment, so there''s no reason not to have the camera on a tripod of some sort and use the lowest light-gathering settings and control the light level.</td>', 'I think this could have been improved with a cleaner surface to set the rubber bands on. I would also have used a smaller aperture for a bit more depth of field, to include the closest part of the first bundle. This looks like a controlled environment, so there''s no reason not to have the camera on a tripod of some sort and use the lowest light-gathering settings and control the light level.', '2014-09-05 20:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259695, 1129043, 13077, '<td valign="top">Are they peppercorns? Very interesting with the shadows and textures.</td>', 'Are they peppercorns? Very interesting with the shadows and textures.', '2014-09-06 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259697, 1128878, 13077, '<td valign="top">Ice stairway? Sounds like so much fun to walk up carrying a bunch of groceries. lol</td>', 'Ice stairway? Sounds like so much fun to walk up carrying a bunch of groceries. lol', '2014-09-06 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7259698, 1128995, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting and abstract for sure, but I''m not a big fan of the mostly white surfaces and the textures.</td>', 'It''s interesting and abstract for sure, but I''m not a big fan of the mostly white surfaces and the textures.', '2014-09-06 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
