(7259701, 1128487, 13077, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like something you''d want to brush up against while you were walking for sure. <br/>I think the photo could have been a little easier on the eyes without the amount of sharpening that was applied to it. The chaotic composition combined with the over sharpening make it hard to look at in my opinion.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like something you''d want to brush up against while you were walking for sure. I think the photo could have been a little easier on the eyes without the amount of sharpening that was applied to it. The chaotic composition combined with the over sharpening make it hard to look at in my opinion.', '2014-09-06 00:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
