(7261608, 1128403, 163081, '<td valign="top">Many thanks for the great votes and nice comments. I just wonder who gave me a 1. Technically it was very difficult the achieve at this macro range. The waterdrop was only 2mm large. I (burned around 10 cd''s to get a good one. I used a mirror to reflect the light (bicycle flashlight) on the cd and get the full spectrum of light on the waterdrop. After all it took me a whole day to get this shot. I experimented with coca cola, water, oil, soap, etc...I''ll post some outtakes.<br/></td>', 'Many thanks for the great votes and nice comments. I just wonder who gave me a 1. Technically it was very difficult the achieve at this macro range. The waterdrop was only 2mm large. I (burned around 10 cd''s to get a good one. I used a mirror to reflect the light (bicycle flashlight) on the cd and get the full spectrum of light on the waterdrop. After all it took me a whole day to get this shot. I experimented with coca cola, water, oil, soap, etc...I''ll post some outtakes.', '2014-09-10 10:53:54.000000', NULL, 0),
